        "right": "0"
      },
      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "a_d2u_sink_consumes_negative_exp",
      "fine_trace_step": 8,
      "description": "ASan crash site. `decUnitCompare()` feeds the overflowed negative exponent delta into `D2U(exp)`, and the macro's `d2utable` lookup reads out of bounds, producing the saved `SEGV` / `wild-addr-read`."
    },
